# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# The repository stores LF, but Windows clones default to core.autocrlf=true
# and write CRLF to disk. Prettier then flags every file, so `pnpm verify`
# can never pass on Windows, and each `pnpm typecheck` leaves a spurious diff
# on the generated contract. Pinning LF here makes checkouts identical
# everywhere, whatever the local git setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Participant documents and other binaries are never line-ending converted.
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
